         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nLong ago, everything in the universe was together, with nothing separate to split. As matter appeared, the universe gained the chance to share and to divide.\n\nIn this class, we study division more closely. We start with a case where dividing and multiplying give the exact same result.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
