         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### They Were Together\n\nAdding the same object 10 times gives a total of 10. What is split today can become a single thing again — just as the universe once was.\n\nNow imagine we recycle the paper: the 10 rectangles become one sheet again.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"80 45 340 130\" width=\"100%\"><rect x=\"105\" y=\"45\" width=\"200\" height=\"85\" fill=\"#ADD8E6\" stroke=\"none\"/></svg></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "A single long rectangle with the height of one small rectangle and the combined length of the ten.",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
