         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nWe learned that multiplying or dividing by 1 always returns the same value. So dividing by 1 is like concentrating everything into one.\n\nMultiplication works the same way: multiplying by 1 takes the value once, so it returns that same value. Everything stays equally concentrated.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
